Proposed Tech Stack
Layer	Technology
Frontend / Input UI	React (or Streamlit for a faster MVP)
Backend / API	FastAPI (Python)
Orchestration	LangChain / LangGraph (for multi-agent orchestration)
LLM-as-Judge	OpenAI GPT-4 / Claude API (configurable)
Embeddings	sentence-transformers (e.g., all-MiniLM-L6-v2) or OpenAI embeddings
Vector Store	ChromaDB / FAISS (local) or Pinecone (managed)
Database (submissions & results)	PostgreSQL / MongoDB
Benchmark Datasets	TruthfulQA, SQuAD (via Hugging Face datasets library)
Evaluation Reference Frameworks	RAGAS, TruLens (for methodology + possible metric reuse)
Deployment	Docker, GitHub Actions (CI)
